OL,3,GNEWSA'We have to be smarter' - animal
OL,4,Arescue centre launches pet mobile
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith rising vet bills and increasing
OL,7,Fconcerns over pet owners struggling to
OL,8,Fcope, a rescue centre has decided to
OL,9,Fput the wheels in motion to help those
OL,10,Fin need.
OL,12,FFreshfields Animal Rescue is now
OL,13,Foperating a pet mobile van across
OL,14,FMerseyside.
OL,16,FWhile the mobile clinic is not an
OL,17,Femergency veterinary service, it is run
OL,18,Fby a vet nurse and a dog behaviourist
OL,19,Fwho can offer basic treatment, advice
OL,20,Fand preventative care.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
