OL,3,GNEWSA'We have to be smarter' - animal
OL,4,Arescue centre launches pet mobile
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe outreach service has been developed
OL,7,Fby Emma Jensen, the charity's director,
OL,8,Fwho said animal charities were
OL,9,Fincreasingly dealing with the
OL,10,Fconsequences of financial hardship.
